{#- _ui.html.j2 — the shared markup of the Apple direction (CLAUDE.md 7). {% import "_ui.html.j2" as ui %}
    Every macro prints only stored or computed values (pipeline/present.py view models); styles: templates/assets/css.
    Rules the macros keep: a value is printed whole, or its main part with '외' pointing to the whole value on the
    page (never an ellipsis); closed days carry class "closed" (red + a square drawn by CSS); a contested value shows
    both sources + "방문 전 전화 확인"; KOGL-3 photos are never cropped (class t3, data-kogl="3"); every outbound
    link keeps data-track / data-provider / data-place.
    Filters and globals used here (pipeline/build.make_env, build()): sup, csup, tojson_attr, pdist (present.dist),
    ko_date, short_iso, nwt (time ranges and prices never break inside), card_vm(e[, photo]).
    Photos go through _media.html.j2 (md.picture / md.credit): <picture> with the same-origin AVIF/WebP derivatives
    of KOGL-1 photos (pipeline/media.py), and data-kogl="1|3|0" on every <img> so the behaviour layer (motion.js,
    site.js) never crops, zooms or morphs anything but KOGL-1.

    Macros (inputs → output):
      icon(name, cls)                 inline SVG icon, stroke = currentColor
      type_icon(e)                    small rounded kind icon for a place without a photo
      img(ph, sizes, eager, cls, lazy_src, high)     <img>/<picture> of a present.photo dict
      figure(ph, cap, idx, total, cls, eager, sizes, credit, named, reveal)   photo + caption with the credit
      status(items, cls)              key-information line as text (present.status_items)
      kfv(s, more_href, compact, place) / kf(K, cls, more_href, place) / kfnote(K) / kfrows(K, place)
                                      key facts (present.key_facts): spec tiles, the note line under them, card rows
      value(r) / factrow(r, fn) / facts(rows, fn, cls)        fact rows (present.fact_rows) — the validated form
      notes(items, cls) / chnotes(items)                      numbered source notes
      route(primary, front, rest, place, hid, nm)             route block: 3 in front, the rest under '다른 지도'
      lnav(title, links, cta, label)  the local bar (base.html.j2 {% block lnav %}): title, section links, one pill
      board(cv, s) / stoprow(stops, …) / linemeta(cv)            course parts (a place page's course
                                      segments, nearby rows and cards: _near.html.j2)
      coursemap(m, title, caption, cls)                       the course's stops on the map (present.course_map)
      mapfig(data, label, cls, caption)                       map box; map.js reads data-map
      faq(items, ns)                  visible Q → A
      chead(title, hid, …) / sec_head(eyebrow, title, hid, …) / rail(hid, label, nm, block, cls){caller}   headings
      opening(title, kicker, lede, count, eyebrow, cls, hid){caller?}   the white page head with the H1
      kicker_line(items) / crumbs(items)                      small path lines
      abar(purposes, ev, hid)         the home answer bar: search · the next event · five purposes with figures
      showcase(slides, sizes, label, high)  the home product-shot photo: KOGL-1 slides, dots, pause
      answer(a, q, id)                answer tile (present.answer_row / guide_rows)
      evrow(r)                        dated event tile (present.ranked_events rows with dp)
      ticket(r)                       event ticket row (present.event_row)
      card(c, cls, sizes, track)      the one place-card component (present.card_vm: photo, kf rows)
      carnav(what)                    the round previous / next buttons of a carousel ([data-gallery])
      rec(it, kind)                   ledger row (present.list_vm items: slots)
      week(W, hid, title)             places × 월–일 (present.week_grid)
      video(v, place, linked, eager, tag) / vrow(v, linked, eager)    video card / compact row, thumbnail facade
      search_form(id, value, label, placeholder, live, note, data)
                                      GET /search/ form (search.js enhances [data-search])
      bento(a){caller} / mark(text, phrase) / nums(items, hid, title, note) / bigword(word)
                                      the home accent points (45-accent.css): colour bento tile, lime marker,
                                      big-numerals band, the black band's oversized word
    Page-only variants live in _p1.html.j2 (place, lists, map, search, videos) and _p2.html.j2 (home, course,
    guide, event, about, 404). -#}

{% import "_media.html.j2" as md %}

